  "description": "2026 has seen the Neapolitan DJ Deborah De Luca turn up the voltage, leaning further into relentless hard techno – minimal and dark, pulsing in peak-time energy.\n\nHer Solamente label delivered her ‘More Rhythm’ EP after its track ‘New Star’ became a hotly requested ID, as well as a run of singles also by De Luca. Behind the decks she’s matched the intensity with her performances, including a takeover of Room 1 at fabric and a headline set at Cocoricò’s iconic La Piramide alongside Sara Landry and Amelie Lens. De Luca is pushing her sound, and herself, harder than ever.",
